{"seq":3,"slug":"lymphocyte-receptors","title":"T 与 B 细胞受体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/lymphocyte-receptors","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"t-与-b-细胞受体\">T 与 B 细胞受体</h1><p><a href=\"../overview/adaptive-immunity\">适应性免疫</a>的全部威力——能识别近乎任意未知抗原——最终落实在两种分子上：B 细胞受体（BCR）和 T 细胞受体（TCR）。它们是淋巴细胞表面的「天线」，每个淋巴细胞只表达一种特异性的受体。本篇专讲这两种受体的分子构造、它们多样性的来源（V(D)J 重组），以及结合抗原后如何把信号传进细胞核——这正是把<a href=\"antibody-structure\">抗体结构</a>与<a href=\"mhc-antigen-presentation\">MHC 呈递</a>两条线索收束在一起的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>BCR 本质上就是固定在 B 细胞膜上的抗体（膜结合型免疫球蛋白），加上一对负责传递信号的 Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>/Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 辅链。当 B 细胞被激活分化为浆细胞后，便把同样特异性的受体大量分泌出去，变成游离抗体。TCR 则是另一种分子：由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 链和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 链组成的异二聚体，每条链同样有可变区和恒定区，但 TCR 永不分泌、永远膜结合，且只识别 MHC-肽复合物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[淋巴细胞受体] --&gt; B[BCR&lt;br/&gt;膜结合抗体+Igα/Igβ]&#10;    A --&gt; C[TCR&lt;br/&gt;αβ异二聚体+CD3复合物]&#10;    B --&gt; D[识别天然抗原&lt;br/&gt;蛋白·糖·脂的构象表位]&#10;    C --&gt; E[识别 MHC-肽复合物&lt;br/&gt;仅线性肽]&#10;    B --&gt; F[激活后分泌为抗体]&#10;    C --&gt; G[永不分泌·需 CD4/CD8 共受体]&#10;    D --&gt; H[VDJ 重组产生多样性]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[胸腺/骨髓中的克隆选择]\">flowchart TD\n    A[淋巴细胞受体] --&gt; B[BCR&lt;br/&gt;膜结合抗体+Igα/Igβ]\n    A --&gt; C[TCR&lt;br/&gt;αβ异二聚体+CD3复合物]\n    B --&gt; D[识别天然抗原&lt;br/&gt;蛋白·糖·脂的构象表位]\n    C --&gt; E[识别 MHC-肽复合物&lt;br/&gt;仅线性肽]\n    B --&gt; F[激活后分泌为抗体]\n    C --&gt; G[永不分泌·需 CD4/CD8 共受体]\n    D --&gt; H[VDJ 重组产生多样性]\n    E --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[胸腺/骨髓中的克隆选择]</pre><p>下表对比两种受体，差异背后是体液免疫与细胞免疫的根本分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>BCR / 抗体</th>\n<th>TCR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>链组成</td>\n<td>2 重链 + 2 轻链</td>\n<td>1 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> + 1 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>识别对象</td>\n<td>天然抗原（构象表位）</td>\n<td>MHC 呈递的线性肽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗原种类</td>\n<td>蛋白、糖、脂、核酸</td>\n<td>几乎仅蛋白来源的肽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否分泌</td>\n<td>可分泌为抗体</td>\n<td>永远膜结合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共受体</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>CD4 或 CD8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号辅链</td>\n<td>Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>/Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>CD3 复合物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"v-d-j-重组-多样性的引擎\">V(D)J 重组：多样性的引擎</h2><p>最关键的问题是：基因组只有约两万个基因，怎么编码出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10^{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种不同受体？答案是 1987 年利根川进获诺奖的发现——V(D)J 重组。受体可变区不是由单一基因编码，而是由基因组中成排的基因片段「拼接」而成：重链可变区由可变（V）、多样（D）、连接（J）三组片段各取一段随机组合，轻链由 V 和 J 两组组合。</p>\n<p>多样性来自三个层次的叠加。其一，组合多样性：不同 V、D、J 片段的随机搭配。其二，连接多样性：拼接处由 RAG 重组酶介导，会随机插入或删除少量核苷酸（N 区），这部分多样性最大。其三，配对多样性：重链与轻链（或 TCR 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）随机配对。三者相乘，总多样性可粗略估为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>junction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{total}} \\approx (V_H \\times D \\times J_H) \\times (V_L \\times J_L) \\times D_{\\text{junction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">junction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正是连接处的随机增删，使实际多样性远超片段组合本身，达到天文数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机性的代价-自反应与耐受筛选\">随机性的代价：自反应与耐受筛选</h2><p>V(D)J 重组的随机性是把双刃剑：它在产生针对未知病原受体的同时，必然会随机产生识别自身分子的受体。免疫系统因此在淋巴细胞「出厂」前设了严格质检，这一筛选在<a href=\"../overview/organs-cells\">免疫器官与细胞</a>所述的中枢器官中进行。</p>\n<p>T 细胞在胸腺经历阳性选择（必须能识别自身 MHC，否则无用而凋亡）和阴性选择（不能强烈识别自身肽，否则危险而被清除）。B 细胞在骨髓中，若未成熟受体强烈结合自身抗原，则被诱导凋亡或启动「受体编辑」更换轻链。这套中枢耐受是防止自身免疫的第一道闸门，它一旦不严，自反应克隆逃逸到外周，就可能引发<a href=\"../health-disease/allergy-autoimmunity\">过敏与自身免疫</a>中讨论的疾病。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受体信号传导-从结合到激活\">受体信号传导：从结合到激活</h2><p>受体抓住抗原只是第一步，必须把「我抓到了」的信息传进细胞内才能触发应答。BCR 和 TCR 的胞内段都很短，本身不能传信号，要靠相伴的信号辅链——BCR 靠 Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>/Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，TCR 靠 CD3 复合物。这些辅链的胞内尾部含有 ITAM 基序，受体交联后被 Src 家族激酶（如 Lck、Lyn）磷酸化，启动级联。</p>\n<p>以 TCR 为例：当 TCR 结合 MHC-肽、CD4 或 CD8 共受体同时锚定 MHC 时，Lck 磷酸化 CD3 的 ITAM，招募并激活 ZAP-70 激酶，进而激活 PLC-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>、引发钙内流和 Ras/MAPK 通路，最终激活 NFAT、NF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span>B、AP-1 等转录因子，开启 T 细胞活化基因（包括 IL-2）。但前文反复强调的「信号二」在此再次出现：单有 TCR 信号一而无共刺激（CD28），T 细胞会进入失能状态。免疫抑制药环孢素正是通过阻断钙调神经磷酸酶-NFAT 通路来抑制这一活化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gamma-delta-t-细胞与受体多样性的边界\"><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞与受体多样性的边界</h2><p>主流叙事是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞，但还有一支少数派——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞，其 TCR 由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 链和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 链组成。它们多分布在黏膜和上皮，识别方式不完全依赖经典 MHC 呈递，能直接感知应激分子或脂类抗原，行为介于先天与适应性免疫之间，是近年<a href=\"../health-disease/tumor-immunotherapy\">肿瘤免疫与免疫疗法</a>中颇受关注的细胞疗法候选。</p>\n<p>这也提醒我们：受体多样性虽以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>/BCR 为主体，但免疫系统在演化中保留了多套识别策略以覆盖盲区。理解经典 V(D)J 重组是骨架，理解这些「例外」才看清识别网络的全貌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BCR 是膜结合抗体（识别天然抗原），TCR 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 异二聚体（只识别 MHC-肽），分别对应体液与细胞免疫。</li>\n<li>V(D)J 重组通过组合、连接、配对三层随机性产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10^{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种受体，连接处增删贡献最大。</li>\n<li>随机性必然产生自反应受体，须靠胸腺/骨髓的中枢耐受筛选清除。</li>\n<li>受体本身不传信号，靠 Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>/Ig<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 或 CD3 的 ITAM 启动激酶级联，且需共刺激信号二防止失能。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞等少数派采用非经典识别策略，补足识别网络盲区。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"T 与 B 细胞受体","id":"t-与-b-细胞受体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"V(D)J 重组：多样性的引擎","id":"v-d-j-重组-多样性的引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"随机性的代价：自反应与耐受筛选","id":"随机性的代价-自反应与耐受筛选"},{"level":2,"text":"受体信号传导：从结合到激活","id":"受体信号传导-从结合到激活"},{"level":2,"text":"\\gamma\\delta T 细胞与受体多样性的边界","id":"gamma-delta-t-细胞与受体多样性的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MHC 与抗原呈递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/mhc-antigen-presentation"},"next":{"title":"炎症与补体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/inflammation-complement"}}